---
description: PWA — decompose page forms into components
globs: pwa/**/*.{ts,vue}
alwaysApply: false
---

# PWA forms

- Decompose page forms into dedicated components under `src/components/` (e.g. `components/auth/LoginForm.vue`).
- Views own page chrome/titles and compose form components — do not keep large form markup inline in views.
- Form components encapsulate fields, client validation (Vuelidate), and emit/submit results to the parent or call stores/services.
